# Keep keys, local data and build output out of the Docker image.
.git
.claude
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.crt
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/node_modules
frontend/dist
server/dist
server/uploads
var
e2e
docs
backend
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Android/iOS app project (built separately, see docs/MOBILE-APP.md)
mobile/

# Secret keys (e.g. Firebase service account) must never be committed or deployed
**/service_account*.json
**/*firebase-adminsdk*.json
**/firebase-service-account*.json
